    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d782">

                <pb facs="0869" n="783" sameAs="frus:frus1903/pg783"/>

                <head><hi rendition="#italic">Mr. Leishman to Mr.
                            Hay.</hi></head>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Legation of the United States</hi>,<lb/><hi rendition="#italic"
                                >Constantinople</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1903-11-13"><hi rendition="#italic">November 13,
                        1903</hi></date>.</dateline>
                    <seg rendition="#float-left">No. 630.]</seg></opener>
                <p><hi rendition="#small-caps">Sir</hi>: I beg to inclose herewith for your
                    information copies of notes exchanged with the Sublime Porte in reference to the
                    attempted assassination of Mr. Magelssen.</p>
                <p>As the notes are self-explanatory, no further comment is necessary.</p>
                <p>I have, etc.,</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">John G. A.
                    Leishman.</hi></signed></closer>






